sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor R as Receptionist
  participant UI as ClinicFlow UI
  participant API as AbdmService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant GW as AbdmGateway (MOCK)
  actor P as Patient

  Note over R,P: ABHA linking (patient consent recorded at the counter)
  R->>UI: Enter ABHA number + "patient agreed"
  UI->>API: POST /patients/{id}/abha/verify-init
  API->>DB: identifier PENDING (encrypted + HMAC), txn ABHA_VERIFY_INIT
  API->>GW: initAbhaVerification(requestId)
  GW-->>API: gatewayTxnId (mock: no OTP actually sent)
  P-->>R: tells OTP
  R->>UI: Enter OTP
  UI->>API: POST /abdm/transactions/{txn}/verify-confirm
  API->>GW: confirmAbhaVerification
  GW-->>API: ok / OTP_MISMATCH / timeout
  API->>DB: identifier VERIFIED (is_mock=true), audit ABHA_LINK_CONFIRM

  Note over R,P: Consent → share a finalized OPD consultation
  R->>UI: Request consent (purpose, HI types, date range, expiry)
  UI->>API: POST /patients/{id}/consents
  API->>GW: requestConsent
  GW-->>API: consentRequestRef (or retryable failure → RETRY_SCHEDULED)
  P-->>GW: approves in PHR app (mock: "Simulate grant")
  API->>DB: consent GRANTED + artefact ref
  UI->>API: POST /consultations/{id}/abdm-share
  API->>API: build FHIR document Bundle + local validation
  API->>GW: pushHealthInformation(consent artefact, bundle)
  GW-->>API: acknowledged (mock: NOT transmitted)
  API->>DB: txn HI_SHARE SUCCESS, care context LINKED, audit HI_SHARE
